Step 1: Install the Function App Infrastructure NativelyCopy and paste this command block into your VS Code terminal and press Enter. This will create your serverless compute housing in the cloud automatically:

PowerShell

# 1. Create a clean Resource Group to hold everything
az group create --name FinOps-Backend-RG --location eastus

# 2. Create a background storage account (Azure requires this for state tracking)
az storage account create --name magelfinopsstor --location eastus --resource-group FinOps-Backend-RG --sku Standard_LRS

# 3. Create your live serverless Function App container
az functionapp create --resource-group FinOps-Backend-RG --consumption-plan-location eastus --runtime node --runtime-version 20 --functions-version 4 --name magel-finops-api --storage-account magelfinopsstor --os-type Windows

